Hi {Owner},

I build websites for tattoo and piercing studios around {City}. {Business Name} has strong work across its artists' feeds, but no site where a client can find the right artist, request a custom piece and leave a deposit.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a portfolio page per artist, a custom tattoo request with size, placement and deposit, a piercing menu with jewellery options, and a flash day page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting, flash updates and artist changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes before you open one day?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
